  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1630.05 Repairs to Bulk Delivery Vehicles",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-01-10",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1630.05 Repairs to Bulk Delivery Vehicles.\n\n(a) Repairs to bulk vehicles shall conform to the requirements of this section.\n\n(b) No welding or open flames shall be used on or around any part of the delivery equipment unless it has been completely washed down and all oxidizer materials removed.\n\n(c) Before welding or making repairs to hollow shafts, the shafts shall be thoroughly cleaned inside and out and vented with a minimum 1/2 inch diameter opening.\n\nSource. #2220, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2837, eff 8-27-84; ss by #4584, eff 3-3-89; ss by #5996, INTERIM, eff 3-3-95, EXPIRES, 7-1-95; ss by #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c1600.html"
